    title: "歐盟發布「AI與資安行動計畫」：將AI用於強化網路防護，並強化AI法案下的安全評估機制",
    summary: "隨著人工智慧（AI）技術加速導入各行各業與公共服務，歐盟執委會發布了「AI與資安行動計畫」。此計畫將AI視為強化網路防護的重要工具，並同時將防範AI被攻擊者濫用列為政策重點。行動計畫主要包含三個方向，旨在確保先進AI的應用是安全且負責任的。特別是，歐盟將依據《AI法案》（AI Act）來強化AI模型在進入歐盟市場前的安全評估機制，確保AI技術的安全性與可信賴性，以應對AI帶來的潛在風險。",
    tags: ["歐盟", "AI法案", "AI與資安行動計畫", "網路防護", "AI安全"],
    title_en: "EU Releases 'AI and Cybersecurity Action Plan': Using AI to Enhance Cyber Defense and Strengthening Security Assessment under the AI Act",
    summary_en: "As Artificial Intelligence (AI) technology accelerates its adoption across various industries and public services, the European Commission has released the 'AI and Cybersecurity Action Plan.' This plan views AI as a crucial tool for enhancing cyber defense while simultaneously making the prevention of AI misuse by attackers a policy priority. The action plan primarily includes three directions, aiming to ensure that advanced AI applications are safe and responsible. Specifically, the EU will strengthen the security assessment mechanism for AI models entering the EU market, based on the AI Act, to ensure the safety and trustworthiness of AI technology in response to potential AI-related risks.",
