    title: "單一惡意包裝載多種惡意程式：Windows後門、挖礦程式與勒索軟體",
    summary: "本篇文章報導了一個惡意軟體包裝的趨勢，該惡意包裝將多種惡意程式（包括後門、挖礦程式和勒索軟體代碼）整合到單一的惡意載體中。這類攻擊的實務影響是極為嚴重且複雜的，攻擊者可以透過一個入口點同時執行多種不同目的的惡意行為，使得防禦與偵測變得更加困難。雖然原文未提供具體的受影響產品、CVE 編號或CVSS分數，但其本質顯示了攻擊鏈的複雜化和多功能化。資安人員應提高警覺，注意來自單一來源的、包含多種不同惡意元件的軟體包，並強化端點偵測與響應能力（EDR），特別是針對行為異常和多階段的攻擊行為進行監控。修補建議應著重於行為層面的安全加固，而非僅依賴單一的簽名比對。",
    tags: ["惡意軟體", "後門", "勒索軟體", "挖礦程式", "Windows", "資安趨勢"],
    title_en: "Single Malicious Package Loads Multiple Types of Malware: Windows Backdoors, Miners, and Ransomware",
    summary_en: "This article reports on a trend in malicious software packaging, where multiple types of malware (including backdoor, mining, and ransomware code) are integrated into a single malicious payload. The practical impact of such attacks is extremely severe and complex, as attackers can execute multiple malicious activities of different purposes through a single entry point, making defense and detection significantly more difficult. Although the original text does not provide specific affected products, CVE IDs, or CVSS scores, its nature highlights the increasing complexity and multifunctionality of attack chains. Security personnel should raise awareness regarding software packages from a single source that contain multiple different malicious components, and strengthen Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) capabilities, especially monitoring for behavioral anomalies and multi-stage attack behaviors. Remediation advice should focus on behavioral security hardening, rather than relying solely on single signature matching.",
    tags_en: ["Malware", "Backdoor", "Ransomware", "Miner", "Windows", "Cybersecurity Trends"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/security/2026/07/10/destructive-windows-backdoor-stuffs-multiple-wipers-and-ransomware-code-into-a-single-package/5270053", lang: "EN" }
    ]
