    category: "Apple",
    title: "iOS 27 Messages App 重大升級：新增繪圖、情境建議與 SiriAI 深度整合",
    summary: "本文介紹 iOS 27 作業系統中 Messages 應用程式的重大功能升級。雖然外觀變化不大，但底層功能大幅改進，提升了用戶體驗。主要新增功能包括：可自訂或完全移除語音按鈕，改善了用戶操作的便利性；新增繪圖功能，允許用戶在訊息中直接繪製草稿，並支援如筆記應用程式的各種標記工具；「情境建議」功能極大地簡化了多步驟流程，例如根據提及的度假地點自動建議相片，或一鍵將活動資訊新增至行事曆；最核心的升級是與 SiriAI 的深度整合。用戶可以透過語音指令讓 Siri 執行複雜任務，例如從群組聊天中抓取特定相片並發送，或從聊天記錄中的圖片提取活動資訊並同步至行事曆。這些功能旨在消除訊息處理流程中的摩擦點，讓用戶能更高效地管理資訊和執行任務。修補建議是升級至 iOS 27 或其公開 Beta 版本以體驗這些新功能。",
    tags: ["iOS 27", "Messages", "SiriAI", "Apple Intelligence", "繪圖功能", "情境建議"],
    title_en: "iOS 27 Messages App Major Upgrade: Adding Drawing, Contextual Suggestions, and Deep SiriAI Integration",
    summary_en: "This article introduces major feature upgrades to the Messages application within the iOS 27 operating system. Although the visual changes are minor, the underlying functionality has been significantly improved, enhancing the user experience. Key new features include: the ability to customize or completely remove the voice button, improving user operational convenience; the addition of drawing functionality, allowing users to draw sketches directly within messages and supporting various markup tools similar to note applications; and the \"Contextual Suggestions\" feature, which greatly simplifies multi-step processes. For example, it can automatically suggest photos based on mentioned vacation locations or add event information to the calendar with a single tap. The most core upgrade is the deep integration with SiriAI. Users can use voice commands to have Siri execute complex tasks, such as grabbing a specific photo from a group chat and sending it, or extracting event information from images in chat history and syncing it to the calendar. These features aim to eliminate friction points in message processing workflows, allowing users to manage information and execute tasks more efficiently. The recommended fix is to upgrade to iOS 27 or its public Beta version to experience these new features.",
