    category: "Android",
    title: "Bixby 應用元件輸出不當導致任意指令執行漏洞 (CVE-2026-21055)",
    summary: "本漏洞（CVE-2026-21055）存在於 Bixby 應用程式的組件輸出處理機制中。在 Bixby 版本 4.0.70.8 之前的版本中，由於不當的應用程式組件匯出處理，允許本地攻擊者利用此漏洞，以 Bixby 的權限執行任意指令。攻擊向量為本地（Local），且無需任何權限（No Privilege）。實務上，這類漏洞可能導致設備的系統控制權被竊取，造成資料洩漏或惡意行為。修補建議是升級 Bixby 應用程式至 4.0.70.8 或更高版本，以修復組件匯出時的安全性缺陷。",
    tags: ["Bixby", "CVE-2026-21055", "Android", "應用程式組件", "任意指令執行"],
    title_en: "Bixby Component Output Improper Handling Leads to Arbitrary Command Execution Vulnerability (CVE-2026-21055)",
    summary_en: "This vulnerability (CVE-2026-21055) resides in the component output processing mechanism of the Bixby application. In versions prior to Bixby version 4.0.70.8, improper application component export handling allows a local attacker to exploit this vulnerability and execute arbitrary commands with Bixby's privileges. The attack vector is Local, and no privileges are required. Practically, such vulnerabilities may lead to the theft of system control over the device, causing data leakage or malicious activity. The recommended fix is to upgrade the Bixby application to version 4.0.70.8 or higher, to patch the security flaw during component export.",
