    title: "Apple提告OpenAI涉嫌竊取商業機密，指控前員工帶走蘋果原型與專有資訊",
    summary: "蘋果公司（Apple）提告OpenAI及其前員工，指控其發生「商業機密盜用和違反合約」行為。蘋果聲稱，OpenAI的員工在任職於蘋果期間，竊取了蘋果的機密硬體資訊，並將其用於推動OpenAI的消費級硬體開發。具體指控包括未經授權存取蘋果系統和機密文件，以及鼓勵求職者在面試時帶入蘋果的原型和組件，甚至透過專有資訊協助OpenAI接近蘋果供應商。OpenAI方面透過其發言人回應，堅稱公司「沒有興趣於其他公司的商業機密」，並強調其專注於開發創新技術。此爭議並非首次，OpenAI與其合作夥伴io Products的硬體努力，此前也曾捲入商業機密爭議。本案涉及的技術細節和具體證據，需參考蘋果的完整訴狀。目前OpenAI已公開否認所有指控。",
    tags: ["Apple", "OpenAI", "商業機密", "法律訴訟", "硬體開發", "前員工"],
    title_en: "Apple sues OpenAI over alleged theft of trade secrets, accusing former employees of taking Apple prototypes and proprietary information",
    summary_en: "Apple has filed a lawsuit against OpenAI and its former employees, alleging 'misappropriation of trade secrets and breach of contract.' Apple claims that OpenAI employees stole confidential hardware information while employed at Apple and used it to drive the development of OpenAI's consumer-grade hardware. Specific allegations include unauthorized access to Apple systems and confidential documents, and encouraging job applicants to bring Apple prototypes and components during interviews, even using proprietary information to help OpenAI approach Apple suppliers. OpenAI, through a spokesperson, responded by firmly stating that the company has 'no interest in the trade secrets of other companies,' emphasizing its focus on developing innovative technology. This dispute is not the first; OpenAI's hardware efforts with its partner io Products have previously been involved in trade secret disputes. The technical details and specific evidence involved in this case require reference to Apple's full complaint. OpenAI has publicly denied all allegations to date.",
