    title: "資安觀察：儘管 Passkeys 被譽為未來，但傳統密碼在登入場景中仍佔據主導地位",
    summary: "本文提出資安觀點，質疑目前業界對 Passkeys（密碼金鑰）過度樂觀的趨勢。雖然 Passkeys 被廣泛推崇為比傳統密碼更安全、更流暢的登入方式，但作者觀察到，在實際的登入場景中，傳統密碼的使用頻率和主導地位仍非常高。這指出了一個重要的實務矛盾：儘管有更先進的技術（如 Passkeys）存在，但許多應用程式和服務的實作和用戶習慣尚未跟上，導致傳統密碼的依賴性依然強勁。文章提醒開發者和資安人員，在推動新技術時，必須正視現有技術的持續影響力，並思考如何更有效地過渡和整合。本篇文章屬於趨勢分析，未提供具體的修補建議，但強調了從技術採用和用戶行為角度進行的整體架構優化。",
    tags: ["Passkeys", "密碼", "身份驗證", "資安趨勢", "登入機制"],
    title_en: "Cybersecurity Insight: Despite Passkeys Being Touted as the Future, Traditional Passwords Still Dominate Login Scenarios",
    summary_en: "This article presents a cybersecurity perspective, questioning the industry's current over-optimism regarding Passkeys. Although Passkeys are widely praised as a more secure and seamless alternative to traditional passwords, the author observes that in actual login scenarios, the usage frequency and dominance of traditional passwords remain very high. This points to a significant practical contradiction: despite the existence of more advanced technologies (such as Passkeys), the implementation and user habits of many applications and services have not kept pace, leading to a strong continued reliance on traditional passwords. The article reminds developers and security professionals that when promoting new technologies, they must acknowledge the persistent influence of existing technologies and consider how to transition and integrate more effectively. This article is a trend analysis and does not provide specific patching recommendations, but emphasizes overall architectural optimization from the perspectives of technical adoption and user behavior.",
    tags_en: ["Passkeys", "Password", "Authentication", "Cybersecurity Trends", "Login Mechanism"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/10/security-bite-passkeys-were-supposed-to-have-killed-the-password-by-now", lang: "EN" }
    ]
